2  says that it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in order to smooth out volatility.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market will be closed Wednesday for a national holiday.\par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-211 2652; peru@dowjones.com [ 10-07-08 1637ET ]\par \par \uc2 1071 1837 5077   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020081007e4a700057\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
