\par\par \b \uc2 Peru Stock Indexes End Mixed; Sol Weakens\b0\par\par\uc2 269 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 April 2008\par 22:46\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended mixed Monday, as a number of mining companies dropped due to weakness in metals prices.\par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the Lima Stock Exchange's general index rose 0.03% to end at 17,474.79.\par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index dropped 0.26% to finish at 28,940.95.\par \par \uc2 The mining subindex dropped 1.49%.\par \par \uc2 Zinc miner Compania Minera Volcan SAA (VOLB.VL) lost 3.5% to end at 7.10 soles ($2.50) as zinc prices eased.\par \par \uc2 Precious metals miner \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA (BVN) lost 1.5% to end at PEN198.00 on weaker gold prices.\par \par \uc2 Financial holding company \uc2 Credicorp Ltd.\uc2  (BAP) rose 0.3% to end at $79.90. The company owns Peru's largest bank, Banco de Credito.\par \par \uc2 The sol weakened Monday, ending at PEN2.8450 to the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at PEN2.7340 to the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 So far this year the sol has appreciated 5.14% against the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  said in a report that the sol will likely continue to appreciate.\par \par \uc2 "The pace of the appreciation, however, will likely slow due to \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action and a declining trade surplus. We forecast the PEN to reach 2.60 per US dollar in 2008 and 2.55 in 2009," it added.\par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 04-21-08 1646ET ]\par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020080421e44l0008g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
