\par\par \b \uc2 Peru Stock Indexes End Mixed; Sol Strengthens   \b0\par\par\uc2 267 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 April 2008\par 23:37\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended mixed Tuesday, as strong gains on Wall Street were offset by falling metals prices that hurt mining company shares.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the Lima Stock Exchange's general index increased 6.99 points, or 0.04%, to end at 17,394.46.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index fell 11.50 points, or 0.04%, to finish at 28,912.45.   \par \par \uc2 Precious metals miner  \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA (BVN) fell 1.7% to end at 184.99 soles ($67.76) as gold prices declined.   \par \par \uc2 Southern Copper Corp.\uc2  (PCU) gained 3.7% to end at $106.80, while financial holding company  \uc2 Credicorp Ltd.\uc2  (BAP) increased 4.9% to end at $75.00.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $228 million at an average of PEN2.7319 to the U.S. dollar.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended slightly stronger, at PEN2.7320 to the U.S. dollar.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at PEN2.7530 to the U.S. dollar.   \par \par \uc2 "The outlook for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to continue tightening monetary conditions supports expectations for market interest rates to continue widening relative to interest rates in the U.S. and for the PEN to appreciate,"  \uc2 Deutsche Bank\uc2  said in a report.   \par \par \uc2 It added that the sol has also been supported by high commodity prices and by strong capital inflows from foreign direct and portfolio investments.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 04-01-08 1737ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020080401e441000gp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
