\par\par \b \uc2 Peru  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Increases Reserve Requirements   \b0\par\par\uc2 326 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Januar 2008\par 03:09\par \uc2 Dow Jones Emerging Markets Report\par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--The Central Reserve Bank of Peru's board of directors on Wednesday increased reserve requirements on bank deposits, aiming to cut down on speculation in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said that it had lifted the reserve requirements on both the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the sol, and on the U.S. dollar.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in recent trading sessions, buying U.S. dollars, in an attempt to stem the speed at which the sol is appreciating. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  decided to increase reserve requirements on dollars in part to restrict the offer of dollars, and to alleviate appreciation pressures on the sol, it said.   \par \par \uc2 It said that the increased reserve requirements on the sol would help sterilize soles that are injected into the economy when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  buys dollars.   \par \par \uc2 It said that from February the minimum legal reserve requirement would increase to 7% from 6%. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also outlined other measures aimed at easing pressure on the sol.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Julio Velarde had said earlier Wednesday in a broadcast interview that raising the reserve requirement would make it more difficult to make a profit from speculation. There has been strong demand for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from foreign investors, some of whom are investing in \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  certificates of deposit.   \par \par \uc2 That demand for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been joined by local investors, market analysts say. Many investors have been looking at rising interest rates in Peru compared with expectations of declining interest rates in the U.S. The sol ended slightly weaker Wednesday at a midrate of PEN2.9515 to the dollar.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Wednesday after purchasing $478.7 million in the previous session, which was a single-day record high.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 17-01-08 0209GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 Dokument EM00000020080117e41h00001\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
