\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes Decline Sharply; Sol Weakens   \b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Dezember 2007\par 22:44\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended sharply lower Friday, as various blue-chip shares lost ground.   \par \par \uc2 The Lima Stock Exchange was dragged down by a sharp decline on Wall Street.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the Lima Stock Exchange's general index declined 537.91 points, or 2.92%, to end at 17,859.86.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index decreased 1,141.69 points, or 3.67%, to finish at 29,973.98.   \par \par \uc2 Southern Copper Corp.\uc2 (PCU) fell 2.7% to end at $105.60, while copper miner Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA (CVERDEC1.VL) lost 3.9% at end at $25.95.   \par \par \uc2 Zinc miner Compania Minera Volcan SAA (VOLB.VL) lost 6.4% to end at 8.33 soles ($2.78) as zinc prices eased.   \par \par \uc2 Telefonica SA\uc2  (TEF) fell 2.8% to end at $96.21, following the direction of its New York-traded American Depositary Receipt.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended at a midrate of PEN2.9765 to the dollar on a spread of PEN2.9760-PEN2.9770.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at a midrate of PEN2.9760 to the dollar on a spread of PEN2.9750-PEN2.9770.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $137 million.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 In a report  \uc2 Barclays Capital\uc2  said, "By far, our preferred long \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  exposure in Latin America" is the Peruvian sol.   \par \par \uc2 It pointed to, among other things, low volatility "with fundamental value due to strong external accounts and low correlation to the global environment."   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 12-14-07 1644ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020071214e3ce0009b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
