\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Sharply Lower; Sol Weakens   \b0\par\par\uc2 278 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Dezember 2007\par 22:48\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended sharply lower Thursday, as declining metals prices hit various miners hard.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the Lima Stock Exchange's general index slid 511.96 points, or 2.71%, to end at 18,397.77.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index fell 839.97 points, or 2.63%, to finish at 31,115.67.   \par \par \uc2 Southern Copper Corp.\uc2  (PCU) lost 3.9% to end at $108.50 and copper miner Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA(CVERDEC1.VL) fell 3.6% at end at $27.00 on a decline in the price of copper.   \par \par \uc2 Financial holding company  \uc2 Credicorp Ltd.\uc2  (BAP) declined 0.9% to $76.30.   \par \par \uc2 The sol weakened against the dollar.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended at a midrate of PEN2.9760 to the dollar on a spread of PEN2.9750-PEN2.9770.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at a midrate of PEN2.9745 to the dollar on a spread of PEN2.9740-PEN2.9750.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $5 million.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 So far this year, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has purchased $10.169 billion.   \par \par \uc2 "For the coming days, pressure to strengthen the sol could become stronger for a tax payment period, although probably there will again be active participation by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange market," Banco de Credito said in a report.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 12-13-07 1648ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020071213e3cd0008k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
