ak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 12-07-07 1621ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020071207e3c70007h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
