\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Sharply Higher;Sol Strengthens   \b0\par\par\uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Dezember 2007\par 23:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended sharply higher Thursday, as strength on Wall Street and rising copper prices lifted blue chip shares.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the Lima Stock Exchange's general index rose 355.25 points, or 1.90%, to end at 19,073.69.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index increased 734.86 points, or 2.32%, to finish at 32,415.81.   \par \par \uc2 Copper miner Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA (CVERDEC1.VL) increased 3.4% at end at $31.00, while  \uc2 Southern Copper Corp.\uc2 (PCU) rose 2.8% to end at $111.00, as copper prices gained.   \par \par \uc2 Precious metals miner  \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA, (BVN) which has a large stake in Cerro Verde, rose 0.6% to end at 164.00 soles. ($54.67)   \par \par \uc2 Financial holding company  \uc2 Credicorp Ltd.\uc2  (BAP) rose 0.6% to end at $73.00.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $218 million.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 Despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  the sol ended stronger, at a midrate of PEN2.9795 to the U.S. dollar on a spread of PEN2.9790-PEN2.9800.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at a midrate of PEN2.9945 to the dollar on a spread of PEN2.9940-PEN2.9950.   \par \par \uc2 One market analyst said that there were a lot of dollars on offer.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 12-06-07 1700ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020071206e3c60009e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
