\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes Decline; Sol Ends Weaker   \b0\par\par\uc2 310 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 November 2007\par 22:37\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended lower Friday, dragged down by a decline in some metals prices that hurt mining company shares.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the Lima Stock Exchange's general index fell 227.74 points, or 1.17%, to end at 19,210.40.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index decreased 399.57 points, or 1.20%, to finish at 32,928.36.   \par \par \uc2 "This is basically a mining stock market. Copper and zinc are weakening a bit due to global uncertainty, so what is happening here is understandable," said former finance minister Pedro Pablo Kyczynski in a radio interview.   \par \par \uc2 Tin miner Minsur SAA (MINSURI1.VL) lost 1.1% to end at 9.10 soles ($3.03), on a decline in tin prices.   \par \par \uc2 Zinc miner Compania Minera Volcan SAA (VOLB.VL) lost 3.2% to end at PEN11.81 as zinc prices eased.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended slightly weaker at a midrate of PEN2.9980 to the dollar on a spread of PEN2.9970-PEN2.9990.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at a midrate of PEN2.9960 to the dollar on a spread of PEN2.9950-PEN2.9970.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $1 million.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 In a report, consulting agency Macroconsult said that recent \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has allowed the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to continue to fluctuate around PEN3.00 to the dollar. "Until the end of the year at least, this appears to be the rate that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the market expect will continue," it added.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 11-16-07 1637ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020071116e3bg000bc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
