 previous session at a midrate of PEN2.9999 to the dollar on a spread of PEN2.9998-PEN3.0000.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 11-05-07 1630ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020071105e3b50007g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
