\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Weaker;Sol Strengthens A Bit   \b0\par\par\uc2 313 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 November 2007\par 21:27\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended lower Friday as a wide range of blue-chip shares fell.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the Lima Stock Exchange's general index fell 349.53 points, or 1.61%, to end at 21,346.74.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index decreased 646.25 points, or 1.72%, to finish at 36,961.62.   \par \par \uc2 Copper miners dropped on a decline in prices for the red metal.   \par \par \uc2 Southern Copper Corp.\uc2  (PCU) dropped 5.4% to end at $132.50, while Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA (CVERDEC1.VL) decreased 1.5% at end at $32.60.   \par \par \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA (BVN), which holds an 18.5% stake in Cerro Verde SAA, declined 4.7% to end at 170.00 soles ($56.67).   \par \par \uc2 Financial holding company  \uc2 Credicorp Ltd.\uc2  (BAP) fell 3.1% to end at $73.00.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $86 million.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in recent sessions, aiming to smooth out movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to purchase some $9.0 billion so far this year. Peru's net international reserves reached a historic high of $24.86 billion as of Oct. 29.   \par \par \uc2 Despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday, the sol ended slightly stronger, at a midrate of PEN2.9999 to the dollar on a spread of PEN2.9998-PEN3.0000.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at a midrate of PEN3.0005 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.0000-PEN3.0010.   \par \par \uc2 The stock market and the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets were closed on Thursday for a national holiday.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 11-02-07 1627ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020071102e3b2000g9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
