\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Lower;Sol Strengthens Slightly   \b0\par\par\uc2 344 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Oktober 2007\par 21:33\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended lower Wednesday as some blue-chip shares fell after posting weaker-than-expected third-quarter earnings.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the Lima Stock Exchange's general index fell 76.19 points, or 0.35%, to end at 21,696.27.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index decreased 187.16 points, or 0.50%, to finish at 37,607.87.   \par \par \uc2 Beverage producer Union de Cervecerias Peruanas Backus & Johnston SAA (BACKUSI.VL), or Backus, declined 9.5% to end at 42.00 soles. ($14)   \par \par \uc2 Backus posted third-quarter net income of PEN81.3 million, dwon from PEN135.7 million in the year-earlier quarter.   \par \par \uc2 Tin miner Minsur SAA (MINSURI1.VL) dropped 3.8% to end at PEN10.10.   \par \par \uc2 Minsur said its third-quarter net income totaled PEN178.1 million compared with PEN171.2 million in the same quarter a year earlier.   \par \par \uc2 Copper miners gained ground, however, with Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA (CVERDEC1.VL) increasing 2.8% to end at $33.10, while  \uc2 Southern Copper Corp\uc2 ,(PCU) rose 1.5% to end at $140.05.   \par \par \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA, (BVN), which holds a stake in Cerro Verde SAA, rose 4.5% to end at PEN178.30.   \par \par \uc2 The stock market will be closed Thursday for a national holiday.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $152 million, a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in recent sessions, aiming to smooth out movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended at a midrate of PEN3.0005 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.0000-PEN3.0010.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at a midrate of PEN3.0015 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.0010-PEN3.0020.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market will also be closed Thursday.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 10-31-07 1633ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020071031e3av000hu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
