\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Higher; Sol Strengthens   \b0\par\par\uc2 320 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Oktober 2007\par 21:47\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended higher Monday, on continued strong interest in Peruvian blue chip shares, boosted by solid economic growth.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the Lima Stock Exchange's general index rose 226.67 points, or 1.04%, to end at 22,036.66.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index increased 524.19 points, or 1.38%, to finish at 38,378.42.   \par \par \uc2 Peru's mining companies continued to post strong growth.   \par \par \uc2 Precious metals miner  \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA (BVN) rose 0.4% to end at 161.30 soles ($53.60).   \par \par \uc2 Company officials said on a conference call with analysts that they expect rising gold production in the short term.   \par \par \uc2 Copper miner Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA (CVERDEC1.VL) increased 1.6% at end at $32.50, while  \uc2 Southern Copper Corp.\uc2  (PCU) rose 3.3% to end at $141.50.   \par \par \uc2 Financial holding company  \uc2 Credicorp Ltd.\uc2  (BAP) gained 3.5% to end at $75.52.   \par \par \uc2 The company's main holding, Banco de Credito, posted third-quarter net income of PEN224.2 million compared with PEN156.4 million in the same quarter a year earlier.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $189 million.   \par \par \uc2 A market analyst said that there was strong demand for soles from the exterior.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in recent sessions, aiming to smooth out movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 Despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the sol ended stronger, at a midrate of PEN3.0095 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.0090-PEN3.0100.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at a midrate of PEN3.0155 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.0150-PEN3.0160.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 10-29-07 1647ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020071029e3at000ss\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
