\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Lower; Sol Weakens   \b0\par\par\uc2 267 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Oktober 2007\par 22:24\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended lower Friday, dragged down by weakness on Wall Street and falling mining company shares.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the Lima Stock Exchange's general index fell 249.62 points, or 1.13%, to end at 21,930.55.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index decreased 489.13 points, or 1.27%, to finish at 38,076.71.   \par \par \uc2 Copper miner Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA(CVERDEC1.VL) lost 1.7% at end at $31.15, while  \uc2 Southern Copper Corp.\uc2  (PCU) fell 1.5% to end at $132.00.   \par \par \uc2 Zinc miner Compania Minera Volcan SAA (VOLB.VL) decreased 1.3% to end at 13.96 soles ($4.62) on a drop in zinc prices.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended slightly weaker at a midrate of PEN3.0215 to the U.S. dollar on a spread of PEN3.0210-PEN3.0220.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at a midrate of PEN3.0200 to the U.S. dollar on a spread of PEN3.0190-PEN3.0210.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.   \par \par \uc2 In a report, Macroconsult said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  appears to be content with the current range in which the sol has been trading.   \par \par \uc2 "As such it doesn't seem that there will be brusk changes in exchange market conditions, as there seems to be a sort of psychological floor in expectations," the consulting firm said.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 10-19-07 1624ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \