\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Stock Indexes End Lower; Sol Weakens   \b0\par\par\uc2 265 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Oktober 2007\par 22:50\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended lower Tuesday on profit taking and on a slide in base metals prices.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the Lima Stock Exchange's general index fell 292 points, or 1.29%, to end at 22,392.39.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index lost 632.28 points, or 1.60%, to finish at 39,007.62.   \par \par \uc2 "Basically what happened today was profit taking after gains in some shares. The metals prices were also lower," said one trader.   \par \par \uc2 Copper miner  \uc2 Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SA\uc2  (CVERDEC1.VL) lost 2.4% to end at $32.36 on weaker copper prices.   \par \par \uc2 Zinc miner  \uc2 Compania Minera Volcan SA\uc2  (VOLCABC1.VL) fell 0.8% to end at PEN14.78 when zinc prices slid. There was heavy trading in both Cerro Verde and Volcan.   \par \par \uc2 Financial holding company  \uc2 Credicorp Ltd.\uc2  (BAP) lost 0.7% to end at $70.01.   \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the sol ended slightly weaker at a midrate of PEN3.0190 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.0180-PEN3.0200.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at a midrate of PEN3.0175 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.0170-PEN3.0180.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $4 million.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in recent sessions, aiming to smooth out movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 -By Rebecca Howard, Dow Jones Newswires;peru@dowjones.com; 51-1-221 7050 [ 10-16-07 1650ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020071016e3ag000dw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
