\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Higher; Sol Unchanged   \b0\par\par\uc2 337 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Oktober 2007\par 22:27\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended higher Friday as a range of blue chip shares gained on optimism about upcoming quarterly financial results.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the Lima Stock Exchange's general index rose 251.11 points, or 1.12%, to end at 22,653.83.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index increased 461.65 points, or 1.18%, to finish at 39,536.97.   \par \par \uc2 Financial consulting firm Macroconsult said that the stock market gained this week due to strong metals prices and on buying before the upcoming release of third-quarter financial results, which are expected to be good for many companies.   \par \par \uc2 Southern Copper Corp.\uc2 (PCU) rose 0.60% to end at $137.60, while copper miner Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA (CVERDEC1.VL) gained 7.0% at end at $32.20, shrugging off lower copper prices.   \par \par \uc2 Zinc miner Compania Minera Volcan SAA (VOLB.VL) increased 0.9% to end at 14.70 soles ($4.88) as zinc prices rose.   \par \par \uc2 Financial holding company  \uc2 Credicorp Ltd.\uc2  (BAP) rose 2.2% to end at $71.50.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended unchanged Friday from the previous session at a midrate of PEN3.0165 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.016-PEN3.017.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $25 million.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in recent sessions, aiming to smooth out movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 Macroconsult also said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been giving signals that it doesn't want the sol to weaken below PEN3.0 to the dollar.   \par \par \uc2 In a report, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said that from Oct. 3 to Oct. 10 the sol appreciated 2.3% from the end of September. In the same period, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to purchase $608 million.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 10-12-07 1627ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020071012e3ac0006s\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Peru near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0